  // Starfall Street (plan 34 · PD5): a stand-in valley of our own north of Mesagoza, where Team Star's five bases stand
  // until plan 34 · PD6 builds the West and North Provinces the originals scatter them over and moves each base there.
  // Its floor is at the plaza's height, shut in by hills on every side, and a pass cut through Mesagoza's north
  // mountains east of the academy leads into it. Read after south_and_east.json and before titans.json (their names
  // sort so), and kept clear of every polygon of titans.json, whose hills would otherwise be laid over it. Our own land,
  // nothing traced
  "brushes": [
